[83.429,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what will be deleted from your Oracle Cloud tenancy (compartment ***):\r\n\r\n  # Everything the Terraform state in .openvidu/oracle holds: the instance, its boot\r\n  # volume, the network the stack created (its VCN, subnet, internet gateway, route table\r\n  # and security list) and its network security groups, the dynamic group and the policy\r\n  # in the tenancy, the bucket's Customer Secret Key, the SSH key's object in the bucket,\r\n  # not the vault: it is yours (--oci-vault), the bucket with the recordings and Meet\r\n  # data.\r\n  terraform -chdir=.openvidu/oracle init -input=false -no-color -force-copy\r\n  terraform -chdir=.openvidu/oracle destroy -auto-approve -input=false -no-color\r\n\r\n--delete-data: the recordings and Meet data are in the Object Storage bucket: this deletes them.\r\nwarning: the vault is not the stack's (--oci-vault), so it stays, and this stack's secrets with it (its URL, its credentials, the license, the stack's access): schedule their deletion in the vault unless you need them\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
